Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; 23 - Make sure Windows Game Mode is on.
; Game Mode lets Windows favour the game in the front: it holds back Windows Update restarts and
; driver installs while you play and gives the game CPU and GPU priority. It is on by default in
; Windows 11; this puts it back on if a "debloat" tool, an old tweak or an OEM set it off.
; Microsoft documents Game Mode in its list of ways to improve gaming performance.
; Undo: menu 7, then 23 (the values are removed, which is how Windows ships).
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Microsoft\GameBar]
"AllowAutoGameMode"=dword:00000001
"AutoGameModeEnabled"=dword:00000001
